  "description": "Community moderation for MintPlayer.Spark: votes and a reputation ledger on IModeratable entities, privileges earned as security.json groups (bounded to reversible rights), ten vote-fraud defences (age and activity gates, diversity, eligibility, caps, delayed crediting, a nightly detector with compensating reversals, hashed network observations), flags and a review queue, locks, suspensions and an audit log. Configured through moderation.json layered under IConfiguration.",
